"markdown": "### Cylinder Reborn\n\nCreate beautiful and smooth animations when paging through your home screen.\n\nA complete rewrite of the iconic Barrel/Cylinder tweak, giving your home screen a unique and personal look whenever you swipe between pages.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
