"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Extensive Effect Library:** Over 50 unique animations for home screen icon paging.\n- **Combine Multiple Effects:** Mix and match several effects at once to build your own custom style.\n- **Lua Script Support:** Integrated Lua scripting engine allows developers to write custom animations.\n- **Smooth Performance:** Highly optimized graphics processing with minimal impact on battery and responsiveness.\n- **Broad Compatibility:** Full support for Rootless, RootHide, and iOS 11.0 through 17.0 environments.",
