"markdown": "### Version 1.2.0\n- Full support for the RootHide environment and Rootless jailbreaks.\n- Improved performance for smoother operation.\n- Fixed the icon of a just-closed app not playing its animation.\n- Fixed many effects that were broken in earlier versions.\n- Fixed effects not working when icons appear on screen.\n- Updated the Lua language to version 5.5.\n- Scripts can now access each icon's row/column information and the icon:center() function.",
